      "reason": "The evidence reports reasons for exclusion (e.g., lack of outcome measures), but it does not distinguish exclusion due to outcomes not being measured from exclusion due to outcome results not being reported."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e4",
      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_10",
      "quote": "In terms of intervention types, 10 studies [24,25,37,38,40,42-45,51] incorporated aerobic exercise; 2 studies [39,52] implemented resistance exercise; 10 studies [23,26,43,4648,50,53-55] employed multicomponent training, which encompassed combinations of the following:",
      "reason": "The evidence indicates groups based on exercise intervention types (aerobic, resistance, multicomponent). However, it does not explicitly link these groups to the specific comparisons defined in the review objectives."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e5",
      "status": "MISSING",
